<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Southdown target raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Southdown target raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it raised the 12-month price target for Southdown Inc to $43 a share from $39.</p>
<p>-- said the outperform rating remained unchanged.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Southdown closed Wednesday at 35-5/8.</p>
</text>
